{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他还拿那个决定逼自己向前，怕一停又退回等待，可曾尝到的亲近与欢喜让他舍不得放下。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回等待\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"一难受，他就认定是自己又在退缩，非得把这股难受压过去才肯停。\",\n      \"key\": \"又在退缩\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他拿当初的决心逼自己不许示弱，连疲惫都当成不争气。\",\n      \"key\": \"不争气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他看见自己已经累得撑不住，还在逼自己硬撑，终于不愿再证明自己能扛。\",\n      \"key\": \"不愿再证明\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他松开对自己的逼迫，心里仍没踏实，却终于肯承认自己舍不得。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时也不知道该怎么办，只知道自己想过上亲近、安心的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心的日子\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留那个曾帮他走出犹豫的决定为何让他舍不得松手，也保留行动仍不够的冲突。把抽象的怕失望说明变心，改成怕停下又退回等待；同时写出曾经尝到的亲近与欢喜仍在牵动他，解释柔和与向前压力为何并存。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把痛苦误认成迟疑、非得克服才肯停的机制。删去重复的怕辜负最初决意，因为 S05-1 已交代他为何害怕停下。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的要求与脆弱改成具体的自我责怪：他拿当初的决心要求自己不许示弱，把疲惫也当成不争气，保留从坚定要求到自我苛责的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他发现自己正在逼一个疲惫的人硬撑，以及不再愿意证明坚强的临界点。用已经累得撑不住的具体处境解释运动衰弱与短暂松动，不再用整齐的反转句总结心理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留停止催逼并没有立即带来安心，却让他终于肯承认不舍的转向。用他实际承认的心理变化替代留了空隙的抽象说法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留茫然与松懈，也把责任之外的舍不得具体为亲近、安心地过日子的愿望，为 S06 将这份依恋辨认成一种生活向往铺路。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "402168cd-aa6b-4e35-8279-8a8bedccca0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T072204789379Z", "elapsed_seconds": 815.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T07:35:40.499094+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6db73bb27214d08a4b44b3c62709641d5b8a2be7926017adcd3f3b96dd0d2526", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T072204789379Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "77183c89e3fd6362e546dd2d24ab330c7c226493c08ccbbf9216bc8001d0dbd6"}}}
